[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ## Accurate Claims ✓
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Qubits in superposition**: Correctly describes that qubits can exist in multiple states simultaneously, unlike classical bits
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Parallel exploration**: Accurately reflects that superposition enables exploring multiple solution paths concurrently
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Exponential speedup for specific problems**: Valid—quantum computers show exponential advantages for particular problem classes (factoring, quantum simulation, optimization)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Specialized tools**: Correct characterization—quantum computers excel at specific domains, not general-purpose computing
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
