[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64067, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64067, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m The summary presents renewable energy in an overly positive light without acknowledging significant practical limitations, such as:
