[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=63431, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **CRISPR precision**: CRISPR-Cas9 does enable highly targeted DNA changes with relative precision compared to earlier techniques
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=63431, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Three application areas mentioned**: All are legitimate current or near-future uses:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=63431, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - Treating genetic diseases (e.g., sickle cell, certain cancers)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=63431, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - Crop improvement (drought resistance, yield)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=63431, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - Biological research (understanding gene function)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=63431, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **"Revolutionary potential"**: Justified—CRISPR has already transformed research speed and accessibility since ~2015
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=63431, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
