[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60086, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m   - Solar and wind are continuously available (though intermittent)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60086, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m   - Hydroelectric depends on water availability/rainfall cycles
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60086, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m   - Geothermal and biomass also exist but aren't mentioned
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60086, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
