[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60085, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## Nuances & Caveats ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60085, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60085, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 1. **"Eliminates the need for a central authority"** — While blockchain *can* reduce dependence on central authorities, some blockchains still rely on:
