[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65388, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m Renewable energy is power generated from naturally replenishing sources such as solar, wind, and hydroelectric systems. These sustainable energy sources offer environmentally friendly alternatives to fossil fuels and help reduce carbon emissions.
