[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Long-term temperature and weather pattern changes**: Correctly describes climate change
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Human activities as a cause**: Accurate - anthropogenic factors are the dominant cause of observed warming since the mid-20th century
