[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m | Claim | Issue |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m |-------|-------|
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m | "predominantly caused by human activities beginning in the 1800s" | **Partially unverified**: While human activities did begin affecting climate in the 1800s (industrialization), the *dominant* human effect on current warming began more recently. The Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC) attributes ~100% of warming since ~1950 to human activities, but pre-1950 contributions were smaller. |
