[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Distributed ledger technology**: Correct. Blockchain maintains copies of data across multiple nodes.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Secure and transparent**: Accurate. Cryptographic hashing and public verification provide both security and transparency.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Multiple computers/decentralized**: Correct. No single point of control or failure.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Difficult to alter retroactively**: Accurate. Changing past blocks requires recalculating all subsequent blocks faster than the network adds new ones (computationally impractical in established chains).
