[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m **"Minimal environmental impact"** — This is an oversimplification:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - While renewable energy produces no direct emissions during operation, the lifecycle impact includes:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Manufacturing impacts (solar panel production, rare earth minerals for wind turbines)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Land use concerns (solar farms, wind farms, hydroelectric reservoirs)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Wildlife impacts (bird/bat deaths from wind turbines, aquatic ecosystems affected by dams)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Battery storage production (for intermittent energy)
