[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - No mention of **intermittency challenges** (weather dependency)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - No discussion of **infrastructure costs** or grid integration requirements
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Other renewable sources exist (geothermal, tidal, biomass)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m The summary is generally accurate but presents an idealized view. For a comprehensive understanding, acknowledge that renewable energy is substantially cleaner than fossil fuels while still having measurable environmental tradeoffs to manage.
