[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ## Important Caveats & Nuance ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Unverified/Incomplete claims:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 1. **"Exponentially faster than classical computers"** - This applies only to *specific* problem types, not universally. Most everyday computational tasks see no quantum advantage.
