[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Existing quantum computers have limited qubits (~1000 maximum) with significant error rates
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - "Quantum advantage" shown only for narrow benchmarks, not practical applications
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Drug discovery and optimization remain largely theoretical; no production-scale successes yet
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Bottom line**: The statement reflects genuine promise, but overstates current capabilities and generalizability.
