[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **They are sustainable alternatives to fossil fuels** — Correct. Renewable sources produce little to no greenhouse gas emissions during operation.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **They don't deplete natural resources** — Correct. Unlike fossil fuels, these sources aren't consumed in the traditional sense.
