[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - Viability depends on storage technology, grid infrastructure, and geographic location
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - Intermittency (weather dependency) remains a challenge
