[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ## What's Accurate
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - ✓ **Core purpose**: Correctly identifies defense against attacks, theft, and unauthorized access
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - ✓ **Scope**: Appropriately mentions computers, networks, and data
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - ✓ **Multi-layered approach**: Accurately reflects that cybersecurity involves technologies, processes, and strategies
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ## What Could Be Expanded
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Additional dimensions worth including:**
