[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 1. **Confidentiality, Integrity, Availability (CIA Triad)** - The foundational security principles
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 2. **Incident response** - What happens after detection
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 3. **Human element** - User awareness and training are critical
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 4. **Compliance & governance** - Regulations (GDPR, HIPAA, etc.) shape cybersecurity practices
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 5. **Continuous evolution** - Threat landscape constantly changes
