[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m Renewable energy is generated from naturally replenishing sources such as solar, wind, and hydroelectric power, making it sustainable long-term. These clean energy sources help reduce carbon emissions and environmental pollution compared to fossil fuels.
