[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 1. **Not universally faster**: Quantum computers don't outperform classical computers on *all* problems—only on specific problem classes. Most everyday computing tasks show no quantum advantage.
