[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64308, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Omits decoherence and error rates** — qubits are extremely fragile and lose their quantum properties quickly, making sustained computation challenging
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64308, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Doesn't explain the "certain complex problems" caveat** — quantum speedup only applies to specific problem types (factoring, optimization, simulation), not all computational tasks
