[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m The summary presents blockchain in an idealized way without acknowledging significant real-world drawbacks, such as:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
