[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Intermittency issues**: Solar and wind are weather-dependent
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Storage challenges**: Batteries/systems needed for consistent supply
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Cost considerations**: Has become competitive but varies by region
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Grid integration**: Technical challenges not addressed
