[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Cryptographic linking**: Accurate. Blocks are linked using hash functions, making tampering detectable.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Decentralized consensus mechanisms**: Valid. Systems like Proof of Work and Proof of Stake enable agreement without central authority.
