[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m   - *True for*: Peer-to-peer transaction validation
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m   - *Not always true for*: Some blockchains have validator concentration, development governance, or reliance on external oracles
