[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m Gene editing technologies like CRISPR enable scientists to make precise, targeted changes to DNA sequences in living organisms. These tools have revolutionary potential for treating genetic diseases, improving crops, and advancing biomedical research.
