[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60083, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - A reader might incorrectly assume quantum computers are general-purpose supercomputers
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60083, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60083, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m A stronger summary would specify that quantum advantage applies to particular problem classes, such as cryptography or molecular simulation, rather than implying broad computational superiority.
