[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Basic definition**: Renewable energy does come from naturally replenishing sources
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Examples cited**: Solar, wind, and hydroelectric power are legitimate renewable sources
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Core concept**: These sources do regenerate and are considered sustainable alternatives to fossil fuels
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Claims Requiring Nuance ⚠
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m **"Do not deplete natural resources"**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Partially accurate but incomplete**: While renewable sources don't deplete fuel reserves like fossil fuels do, they have other resource considerations:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Large hydroelectric projects can deplete water resources or alter ecosystems
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Solar panel and wind turbine manufacturing requires mining of materials (rare earth elements, metals)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Land use impacts vary by technology and location
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m **"Continuously regenerate"**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Technically true but context-dependent**: 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Solar and wind availability varies with weather and time of day
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Hydroelectric depends on water availability (drought-dependent)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m   - Still more reliable than fossil fuels but not uniformly constant
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Other renewable sources**: Geothermal, biomass, tidal, and wave energy
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Challenges**: Grid storage, intermittency, initial infrastructure costs
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Environmental trade-offs**: Not entirely impact-free
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m **Overall Assessment**: The summary provides a solid foundational understanding but benefits from acknowledging that "sustainable" doesn't mean "impact-free."
