[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64574, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Accurate Points ✓
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64574, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64574, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m Your overview correctly identifies the **core technical components**:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64574, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
