[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64574, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **AI/Machine learning** for decision-making and pattern recognition
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64574, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Automated control systems** for steering, acceleration, and braking
