[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m The summary presents nanotechnology as predominantly positive and transformative but doesn't mention significant barriers that exist in practice, such as:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Manufacturing scalability issues
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Safety and toxicology concerns
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - High costs of development
