[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Rationale for improvements:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Added specificity**: Replaced vague "mitigate climate change" with precise "reduces greenhouse gas emissions"
