[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 1. **"Exponentially faster" generalization**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - *Caveat*: This applies only to *specific problem classes*, not all problems. Quantum speedup is problem-dependent.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Quantum computers won't necessarily be faster for all tasks (e.g., word processing, basic calculations).
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
