[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m Blockchain is a distributed ledger technology that achieves security and transparency by storing data across multiple computers and using cryptographic hashing and consensus mechanisms to make retroactive alterations computationally infeasible, while allowing all participants to verify transactions.
