[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **More precise language**: "computationally infeasible" replaces vague "difficult"
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Maintains accessibility** while adding technical depth
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64831, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Balanced**: Still works as a one-sentence introduction while incorporating the fact-check's clarifications
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m # Analysis of This Blockchain Summary
