[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Distributed ledger technology**: Correct. Blockchain is a shared database replicated across many nodes.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Secure transaction recording**: Accurate. Cryptographic hashing provides security.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Multiple computers/decentralized structure**: Correct. No single point of control.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Tamper resistance**: Valid. Altering past blocks requires redoing all subsequent computational work.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64834, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Transparency**: Accurate for most blockchains. Transaction data is typically visible to all participants.
