[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Accurate Claims ✓
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Distributed ledger system**: Correctly describes blockchain's fundamental architecture
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Securely records transactions**: Accurate—uses cryptographic hashing and digital signatures
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Multiple computers**: Correct—blockchain operates across a network of nodes
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Cryptographic protocols**: Verified—uses SHA-256, elliptic curve cryptography, etc.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Decentralized architecture**: Accurate description of most blockchain implementations
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Transparent design**: Correct—transaction records are generally visible to network participants
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Resistant to tampering**: Verified—changing past blocks requires recalculating all subsequent blocks faster than the network can add new ones
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Audit trail**: Accurate—maintains immutable transaction history
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Areas Needing Clarification ⚠️
