[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - More accurate: "resistant to tampering *provided the network maintains honest majority*"
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Vulnerable to 51% attacks if one entity controls >50% of network hash power
