[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Summary doesn't clarify this applies primarily to **public blockchains** (Bitcoin, Ethereum)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Private/permissioned blockchains operate differently
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60728, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Energy consumption and scalability tradeoffs not mentioned
