[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **CRISPR enables targeted DNA changes** - Verified. CRISPR-Cas9 is a well-established gene-editing system that can locate and modify specific DNA sequences.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **High precision capability** - Verified. CRISPR demonstrates strong targeting accuracy, though off-target effects can occur and vary by implementation.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Applications in genetic disease treatment** - Verified. Clinical trials are underway for conditions like sickle cell disease and certain inherited blindness.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Agricultural applications** - Verified. Gene editing is being explored for crop improvement and disease resistance.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Research advancement potential** - Verified. Gene editing tools significantly accelerate biological research.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
