[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m | "Transformative potential" | True but premature for many applications—most clinical uses are still in trial phases |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m | "High precision" | Accurate, but off-target editing remains a concern requiring ongoing refinement |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m | Disease treatment | Currently limited to serious genetic disorders; not yet widely available therapeutically |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
