[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Example defenses (firewalls, encryption, multi-factor authentication)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ### 2. **Missing Key Dimensions**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m The summary focuses primarily on the defensive/protective angle but omits:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Human factor**: Social engineering and security awareness
