[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m # Weakness of the Summary
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Lack of specificity about current limitations and real-world challenges:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m The summary presents autonomous vehicles in an overly simplified, almost idealized manner. It doesn't acknowledge that:
