[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **CRISPR's precision**: CRISPR-Cas9 does enable relatively precise DNA edits compared to earlier technologies
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Medical applications**: Gene editing shows genuine promise for treating genetic disorders (sickle cell disease, certain cancers, etc.)
