[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m | "Precise changes to DNA sequences" | Partially verified | CRISPR is precise but can have off-target effects; accuracy varies by context |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m | "Significant potential applications" | Verified | Multiple clinical trials underway, but most remain experimental |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m | "Long-term effects" | Unverified | Long-term human data is limited; animal studies ongoing |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Missing Context
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - CRISPR is not the only gene-editing tool (zinc finger nucleases, base editors, prime editors also exist)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Regulatory status varies significantly by country
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - No distinction between somatic vs. germline (heritable) editing
