[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66380, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m Gene editing technologies such as CRISPR enable scientists to make precise, targeted changes to DNA sequences in living organisms. These tools have revolutionary potential applications in treating genetic diseases, improving crops, and advancing medical research.
