[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ### Overstated Claims ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 1. **"Individual atoms and molecules"** - Current nanotechnology primarily works with *groups* of atoms/molecules and nanostructures, not typically individual atoms one-by-one
