[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## Accurate Points ✓
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Superposition concept**: Correctly describes qubits existing in multiple states simultaneously
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Parallel processing**: Accurately captures that quantum computers can explore many possibilities concurrently
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Application areas**: The three mentioned domains (cryptography, optimization, molecular simulation) are legitimate areas where quantum advantage is theoretically possible
