[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## Important Caveats & Nuances ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 1. **"Exponential faster"** — Needs qualification
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m    - Quantum speedup is *problem-dependent*; not all problems see exponential gains
