[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m    - Scalability requirements
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m    - Decoherence issues
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m    - Need for quantum-literate problem formulation
