[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ## Claims Requiring Nuance ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **"Operate independently on roads without requiring human drivers"**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - *Current reality*: Most autonomous vehicles in operation are Level 2-3 (SAE scale), meaning they still require human supervision and intervention
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - *Exception*: A few robotaxi services operate at Level 4 (no human required) in limited geographic areas, but this is not yet widespread
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - *Future claim*: True for eventual deployment, but not current reality
