[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - ✓ *Potential is real*: Studies suggest AVs could reduce accidents caused by human error
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - ⚠️ *Unverified at scale*: Safety data is still limited; AVs haven't been deployed widely enough to conclusively prove reduced accident rates overall
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - ⚠️ *Edge cases remain*: AVs still struggle with rare, complex scenarios
