[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Regulatory/legal status varies by region
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Timeline to full autonomy is uncertain
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Cybersecurity and data privacy concerns not mentioned
