[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m This is a **well-written, accurate summary** of autonomous vehicle technology. Here's my assessment:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## Verified Accurate Elements ✓
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Core definition**: Correctly describes AVs as self-driving vehicles
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Sensor types**: Cameras, radar, and lidar are indeed standard sensing technologies used in autonomous vehicles
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **AI role**: Accurately characterizes AI's function in perception and decision-making
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Basic functionality**: Correctly describes route planning and obstacle detection
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## Areas That Could Be Enhanced
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m | Aspect | Note |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m |--------|------|
