[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Specificity**: Names concrete defensive techniques (firewalls, encryption, MFA) instead of vague "protective measures"
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Comprehensiveness**: Adds the reactive/recovery dimension (incident response, ongoing monitoring) beyond just prevention
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Practical context**: Implies continuous, layered defense rather than static protection
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Scope clarity**: Addresses both technical safeguards and operational processes
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Stakeholder relevance**: "Business continuity" signals that cybersecurity serves organizational resilience, not just IT departments:task_name:_strands_fanout_task
