[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60088, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m Climate change encompasses long-term alterations in global temperatures and weather patterns, predominantly caused by human activity beginning in the industrial era. These shifts represent one of the most pressing environmental challenges facing our planet today, with widespread impacts on ecosystems, economies, and human societies.
