[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **1. "Exponential speed" is context-dependent**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Quantum advantage only applies to *specific* problem types
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Not all problems see exponential speedup; some see polynomial improvements
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65111, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Classical computers may still be optimal for many tasks
