[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Tampering resistance**: Altering past records requires recalculating subsequent blocks, which is computationally difficult
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Reduced central authority**: No single entity controls the system
