[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - "Trustlessness" is an ideal; actual trust still exists (in code, miners, etc.)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Not all applications benefit from decentralization
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
