[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60085, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m This omission risks giving readers an inflated sense of quantum computing's immediate impact, when the reality is that widespread quantum advantage is still years or decades away. A more balanced summary would acknowledge both the theoretical promise and the substantial engineering challenges that remain.
