[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ## Claims Requiring Clarification ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 1. **"Exponentially faster" — Needs context**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m    - True for *specific* problems (factoring, discrete logarithm, certain optimization tasks)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m    - NOT universally true—quantum computers won't accelerate all problems
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m    - Many classical problems show only polynomial speedup
