[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m    - Slightly misleading: qubits don't store exponentially more *usable* information than bits
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m    - The advantage is in processing *certain types* of information, not sheer storage
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m    - Measurement collapses superposition to a single output
