[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Clarified "immutable"** by framing it functionally rather than absolutely (highly resistant, enabling trustless systems)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Maintained accuracy** while improving accessibility and relevance for readers unfamiliar with blockchain
