[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64311, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Not all "autonomous" vehicles** operate completely without human intervention
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64311, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - The **SAE automation levels** (0-5) show a spectrum:
