[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Distributed ledger technology**: Correct. Blockchain distributes copies of transaction records across many nodes.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Secure and transparent records**: Accurate. Blockchain uses cryptographic hashing and is publicly viewable (in most cases).
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Multiple computers simultaneously**: Valid. The network is decentralized across participants.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Prevents tampering**: True. Cryptographic linking of blocks makes retroactive changes computationally prohibitive.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Requires network consensus**: Correct. Consensus mechanisms (Proof of Work, Proof of Stake, etc.) validate new blocks.
