[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m The summary uses very broad, general language ("malicious digital attacks," "security measures," "protocols") without providing concrete examples or explaining what specific cybersecurity practices actually entail. A stronger summary would mention particular threats (e.g., malware, phishing, ransomware) or specific defensive strategies (e.g., encryption, firewalls, multi-factor authentication) to give readers a clearer understanding of what cybersecurity actually involves.
