[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m **Lack of specificity about actual impact or scale:** The summary makes broad claims about renewable energy helping to "reduce dependence on fossil fuels and lower greenhouse gas emissions," but provides no concrete data, percentages, or real-world examples to support these assertions. 
