[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **CRISPR enables precise, targeted DNA changes**: Correct. CRISPR-Cas9 is designed to cut DNA at specific sequences with high accuracy.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Gene editing has potential for treating genetic diseases**: Verified. Multiple clinical trials are underway (e.g., sickle cell disease, beta-thalassemia treatments approved by FDA).
