[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Ethical concerns about germline (heritable) editing
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Questions about equitable access and cost
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Environmental risks of edited organisms
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Regulatory and safety uncertainties
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m A more complete summary would present both the promise and the legitimate concerns surrounding gene editing technology.
