[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Parallel processing**: Accurate—this enables exploration of multiple computational paths concurrently
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Problem-specific advantage**: Well-stated—quantum computers don't universally outperform classical computers; they excel at specific problem classes (factoring, optimization, simulation, etc.)
