[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - ✓ Remains accessible for beginners while being more tangible
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59865, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - ✓ Balances abstraction with real-world application:task_name:_strands_fanout_task
