[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m Space exploration is the scientific and technological investigation of outer space through both automated robotic missions and crewed expeditions. It combines astronomy with advanced space technology to study and explore the cosmos beyond Earth's atmosphere.
