[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Decentralized structure**: Blockchain does distribute data across multiple nodes rather than centralizing it
