[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - This is somewhat oversimplified. While renewables are *much cleaner* than fossil fuels, they do have environmental impacts:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - **Solar**: Manufacturing panels, land use, waste disposal
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - **Wind**: Bird/bat mortality, noise, visual impact, blade disposal challenges
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - **Hydropower**: Ecosystem disruption, methane from reservoirs, habitat loss
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - The impact is *far less* than fossil fuels, but claiming "no significant harm" overstates the case
