[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m Autonomous vehicles are self-driving cars that rely on sensors, artificial intelligence, and automated control systems to perceive their environment and make driving decisions independently. These technologies enable vehicles to navigate roads, detect obstacles, and respond to traffic conditions without requiring a human driver to intervene.
