[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Parallel processing capability**: Correct. Superposition enables exploration of multiple computational paths concurrently.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Application areas**: Accurate. The mentioned domains (cryptography, optimization, molecular simulation) are established areas where quantum computers show theoretical advantages.
