[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64308, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Cryptographic security**: Verified—blockchain uses cryptographic hashing and digital signatures to secure data.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64308, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Transparency**: Accurate—participants can view transaction histories (though privacy features vary by implementation).
