[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## Accurate Statements ✓
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Qubits and superposition**: Correctly describes that qubits can exist in superposition, representing multiple states simultaneously
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Parallel processing advantage**: Accurately notes the computational advantage from parallel exploration of solution spaces
