[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Tamper resistance**: The cryptographic linking of blocks does make retrospective alterations computationally difficult
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Transparency and verifiability**: Participants can access and verify the transaction history
