[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65388, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m Additionally, the summary focuses heavily on *technical defenses* (firewalls, encryption, access controls) while omitting the equally important human and organizational aspects of cybersecurity, such as employee training, security policies, incident response procedures, and risk management—which are critical to any comprehensive cybersecurity strategy.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
