[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65588, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Mention of **quantum entanglement** (another key principle)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65588, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Acknowledgment that **quantum advantage is emerging but not yet widespread** for real-world problems
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65588, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Reference to **quantum error correction** challenges
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65588, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Clarification that this applies to *specific* problem classes rather than general computing
