[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60088, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## 📋 Minor Observations
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60088, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60088, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - The list of examples (solar, wind, hydro) is accurate but incomplete—geothermal and tidal energy are also renewable sources worth noting.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60088, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - The claim is appropriately framed as an overview rather than making unverified efficiency or cost claims.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60088, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60088, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m **Overall Assessment**: This is a solid, factually sound summary suitable for general audiences. Adding context about intermittency and lifecycle considerations would make it more comprehensive.
