[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ## Areas Needing Clarification or Nuance
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ⚠️ **"Resistant to tampering" - Partially verified but needs context**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Blockchains are highly resistant to retroactive tampering due to cryptographic hashing
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - However, they're vulnerable to 51% attacks and other consensus mechanism exploits
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - More precise: "resistant to tampering *given sufficient network decentralization*"
