[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m The summary presents autonomous vehicles in an overly optimistic light by stating they "safely navigate roads" as if this is a fully resolved capability. It fails to mention significant real-world limitations such as:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
