[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **"Transparency"**: While blockchain records are typically transparent (all participants can see transactions), this depends on implementation. Private blockchains restrict visibility. The claim could be more precise: *"can be transparent"* rather than inherently transparent.
