[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ⚠️ **"Without human intervention"**: This oversimplifies current reality:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Most deployed autonomous vehicles today are Level 2-3 (SAE scale), requiring human monitoring
