[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ⚠️ **"Safely navigate"**: Success varies significantly:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Safety records are mixed and hard to compare directly to human drivers
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Data on autonomous vehicle accidents remains limited and contested
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Performance depends heavily on weather, terrain, and traffic complexity
