[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Regulatory status**: Varies drastically by jurisdiction; no universal standards yet
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Limitations**: Weather (heavy rain/snow), complex intersections, edge cases still challenge current systems
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Development stage**: Technology is rapidly evolving; today's limitations may change quickly
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60914, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Overall Assessment**: The description is generally accurate but leans optimistic on current deployment realities.
