[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Accurate Statements ✓
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Distributed ledger technology**: Correctly describes blockchain as data stored across multiple nodes
