[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ## Accurate Elements ✓
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Long-term temperature and weather pattern changes**: Correctly describes climate change as gradual shifts over extended periods
