[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ## Minor Clarifications
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **"Primarily" vs. "dominantly"**: The summary uses "primarily," which is accurate but understates the scientific consensus. Current warming is attributed to human activity at ~97% certainty among climate scientists
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Missing specifics** (not errors, just incomplete):
