[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Nuances & Caveats ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m **Safety claims need context:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Accident reduction is *theoretical* in many conditions—real-world data is still limited and mixed
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Current AVs perform better on highways than in complex urban/weather scenarios
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Safety varies significantly by manufacturer and deployment conditions
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m **Technology maturity varies:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - No fully autonomous Level 5 vehicles are commercially available yet
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Most deployed systems are Level 2-3 (partial automation requiring human oversight)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Technology is still evolving rapidly
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64575, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
