[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Long-term temperature and weather pattern changes**: Confirmed by extensive climate data and scientific consensus
