[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Claims Requiring Clarification
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ⚠️ **"Predominantly caused by human activities"** - While scientifically accurate, this phrasing could benefit from specificity:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - The IPCC (2021) states human influence is responsible for approximately 1.07°C of the 1.1°C warming since pre-industrial times
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Primary drivers: CO₂ (fossil fuel burning), methane, deforestation, industrial processes
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60730, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ⚠️ **"Since the Industrial Revolution"** - Slightly imprecise:
