[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65748, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65748, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Applications in crop improvement**: Confirmed. CRISPR is used to enhance disease resistance, yield, and nutritional content in crops.
