[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65748, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m   - Ethical concerns about germline (heritable) editing
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65748, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m   - Regulatory approval processes are lengthy
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65748, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
