[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Reduce fossil fuel dependence** — True; renewables displace fossil fuel use in energy generation.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Mitigate climate change** — Verified; renewables have lower lifecycle emissions than fossil fuels.
