[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ## Areas Worth Clarifying
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **"Help mitigate" vs. eliminate climate change** — While renewables are crucial, they alone don't solve climate change (requires broader systemic changes including efficiency, electrification, and other sectors).
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Heat generation specificity** — Direct heat from solar/wind is limited; heat typically comes from solar thermal systems or byproducts, not wind directly.
