[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m The summary presents autonomous vehicles as a straightforward technological achievement without acknowledging significant real-world obstacles. It doesn't mention:
