[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Targeted drug delivery**: Still largely in development; few clinical applications are fully established
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Stronger/lighter materials**: Carbon nanotubes and graphene show promise, but manufacturing challenges and cost remain significant
