[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Suggestions for Improvement
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Specify which consequences (sea level rise, biodiversity loss, weather extremes, etc.)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Consider noting the greenhouse gases beyond CO₂ (methane, nitrous oxide)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Mention the quantified warming (approximately 1.1°C since pre-industrial times)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
