[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m The summary presents autonomous vehicles as a fully realized, operational technology, but it doesn't acknowledge that:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
