[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Doesn't note that immutability refers to the *chain structure*, not transaction reversibility
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Scalability and speed limitations not addressed
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Overall**: The summary is substantially accurate for a general introduction, but would benefit from these nuances for a more complete picture.
