[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **"Exponentially faster"** — Accurate for some algorithms (Shor's algorithm for factoring) but not universal; some quantum advantages are polynomial, and for many problems no quantum speedup exists
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Current state unclear** — Summary doesn't clarify whether this describes theoretical potential or present-day capabilities
