[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 3. **Practical limitations not addressed**: 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Qubits are extremely fragile (decoherence)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Error rates remain high
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Current machines have limited qubit counts
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Requires quantum error correction (overhead)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 4. **"Vast amounts" is vague**: The advantage depends more on *algorithm structure* than raw data volume.
