[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64065, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m ## Nuances & Clarifications
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64065, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64065, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 1. **"Transparent"** - Partially qualified
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64065, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m    - Transactions are visible on most public blockchains
