[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **They offer environmentally friendly alternatives to fossil fuels** — Accurate. Renewable energy produces significantly lower greenhouse gas emissions than coal, oil, or natural gas during operation.
