[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Geographical limitations**: Solar and wind effectiveness varies by location and climate
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Storage challenges**: Intermittency requires battery storage or grid management solutions
