[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m This makes the summary sound more straightforward and optimistic than the reality warrants. A reader might overestimate how close we are to routine genetic disease treatments, or underestimate why therapeutic applications remain largely experimental rather than widely available.
