[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Don't automatically solve *all* complex problems faster
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Show advantage only for *specific* problem classes (factoring, certain optimization problems, quantum simulation)
