[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66584, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m Nanotechnology involves manipulating matter at the atomic and molecular level to create new materials and devices with novel properties. Its applications in medicine and materials science have led to significant breakthroughs, including targeted drug delivery, stronger lightweight materials, and improved diagnostics.
