[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Automated control**: Vehicles do have automated steering, acceleration, and braking systems
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Goal of independence**: The stated objective of reducing human intervention is correct
