[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Level 5 (fully autonomous in all conditions) doesn't yet exist in commercial deployment
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60705, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Most "autonomous" vehicles still require human oversight or operate in limited geographic/weather conditions
