[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m **Lack of specificity about sensor types and AI limitations:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m The summary mentions that autonomous vehicles use "sensors" and "artificial intelligence" but doesn't explain *which* sensors (LiDAR, cameras, radar, etc.) or *what* kinds of AI (machine learning, neural networks, etc.). More importantly, it doesn't acknowledge any limitations or challenges these technologies face, such as:
