[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Manufacturing solar panels and wind turbines requires energy and materials
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Large hydroelectric dams can affect ecosystems and water systems
