[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m Blockchain is a distributed ledger technology that securely records transactions across multiple computers, ensuring transparency and immutability through cryptographic verification. This decentralized approach eliminates the need for a central authority and makes tampering with records extremely difficult.
