[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ## ✓ Accurate Claims
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Distributed ledger technology** - Correct; blockchain distributes data across multiple nodes
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Records transactions across many computers** - Accurate description of the distributed nature
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Secure and transparent** - Well-founded; cryptography provides security and immutability provides transparency
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Decentralized control** - Valid; no single authority controls the network
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Resistant to fraud and tampering** - Generally accurate due to cryptographic hashing and consensus mechanisms
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Permanent, verifiable record** - Correct; the immutable ledger creates an auditable history
