[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64308, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## Claims Requiring Nuance ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64308, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64308, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m | Claim | Notes |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64308, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m | "Minimal environmental impact" | **Partially accurate but oversimplified.** While renewables produce zero direct emissions during operation, they have environmental costs including: land use, manufacturing impacts, habitat disruption (especially wind and hydroelectric), and mining for rare earth elements. "Lower" would be more precise than "minimal." |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64308, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m | "Essential for addressing climate change" | **True but incomplete.** Renewables are *necessary* but not sufficient alone—energy efficiency, grid modernization, and other solutions are also essential. |
