[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m Climate change is the rapid acceleration of global temperatures and weather pattern shifts caused primarily by human greenhouse gas emissions from fossil fuel combustion, deforestation, and industrial activities since the mid-20th century, with accelerating environmental consequences including sea level rise, extreme weather, and ecosystem disruption.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59864, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
