[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## Important Caveats
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m **Safety claims need context:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Current AVs haven't conclusively demonstrated *overall* safety superiority in real-world conditions yet
