[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m **Traffic congestion:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Benefits depend heavily on adoption rates and implementation (mixed human/autonomous traffic may worsen congestion initially)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - This is more theoretical than demonstrated at scale
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m **Technology maturity:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Most AVs today are "Level 2-3" (driver assistance, not true autonomy)
