[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66584, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m Nanotechnology operates at the atomic and molecular level to create novel materials and devices with unprecedented properties. Its applications range from targeted drug delivery in medicine to stronger, lighter materials for industrial use.
