[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Decentralized structure**: Accurate—blockchain doesn't require a central authority
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Cryptographic validation**: Valid—cryptographic hashing is used to secure transactions
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Immutability**: Generally accurate—altering past records is computationally infeasible due to the chain structure
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ## Nuances & Caveats ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m **"Ensures transparency"**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - *Partially qualified*: Transparency applies to transaction visibility on the ledger, but wallet identities are pseudonymous rather than transparent. Privacy varies by blockchain type.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m **"Immutability"**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - *Not absolute*: While extremely difficult, immutability isn't mathematically guaranteed. Theoretical risks include:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m   - 51% attacks on proof-of-work systems
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m   - Consensus rule changes (as seen in various hard forks)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m **"Eliminates the need for central authority"**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - *Context-dependent*: This applies to data validation but not entirely to governance. Many blockchains have:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m   - Validator cartels or concentration
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m   - Development teams with significant influence
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67427, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m   - Upgrade decisions made by stakeholder groups
