[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65588, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Records transactions**: Accurate function of blockchain networks
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65588, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Decentralized architecture**: Valid characterization of most blockchain implementations
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65588, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Prevents tampering**: Cryptographic hashing and consensus mechanisms do provide strong tamper resistance
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65588, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Permanent records**: Blockchain's immutability is a core feature
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65588, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **No single entity control**: Accurate for truly decentralized blockchains
