[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66733, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m A reader unfamiliar with ML might still struggle to understand what it actually *does* in the real world, making the summary feel somewhat disconnected from practical relevance. Including even one simple example would strengthen it significantly.
