[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m # Autonomous Vehicles
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m Autonomous vehicles are self-driving cars equipped with sensors, artificial intelligence, and automated control systems that enable them to navigate roads and make driving decisions independently. These systems process real-time environmental data to detect obstacles, interpret traffic signals, and adjust speed and direction without requiring a human driver's intervention.
