[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66733, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **"Beginning in the 1800s"**: While industrialization started then, the most significant atmospheric CO₂ increases and measurable global temperature rises occurred in the 20th-21st centuries. The summary might be clearer specifying that industrial emissions began then, but impacts accelerated later.
