[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Valid applications**: The mentioned uses (treating genetic diseases, crop improvement, research) are legitimate and well-established
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Appropriate scope**: The summary appropriately presents gene editing as a tool with multiple applications
