[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Decoherence and error rates**: Current quantum computers are highly error-prone and require error correction
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Scalability challenges**: Building large numbers of stable qubits remains technically difficult
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Limited current applications**: Few problems have demonstrated practical quantum advantage (quantum supremacy has been achieved for specific tasks, but with limited real-world relevance)
