[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **"Ensures transparency"**: Mostly true, but requires clarification
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m   - Transaction visibility depends on blockchain type (public vs. private)
