[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m   - Immutability is achieved through cryptographic hashing and consensus mechanisms, not *just* decentralization
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m   - Blockchain can theoretically be altered if 51% of network nodes collude
