[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m The summary presents quantum computing as an imminent revolutionary force but doesn't mention that quantum computers are still largely in experimental stages with significant practical barriers. It doesn't address:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
