[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Scalability challenges**: Scaling up to the number of qubits needed for practical applications remains unsolved
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Current applicability**: Most real-world applications are still theoretical rather than currently deployed
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m By omitting these critical caveats, the summary risks giving readers an inflated impression of quantum computing's immediate impact, when in reality we're still years or decades away from most of the promised applications becoming practical.
