[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Intermittency issues**: Solar and wind depend on weather conditions and require storage solutions or grid management
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Resource limitations**: Mining for materials (lithium, cobalt) for batteries has environmental impacts
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Land use considerations**: Large-scale solar and wind farms require significant land area
