[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60088, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **They reduce dependence on fossil fuels** – Accurate. Renewable energy displaces fossil fuel consumption in the energy mix.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60088, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **They help mitigate climate change** – Verified. Renewables produce little to no greenhouse gas emissions during operation.
