[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Automation**: Control systems execute steering, acceleration, and braking
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Basic function**: These systems enable vehicle operation without continuous human input
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m ## ⚠️ Points Needing Nuance
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m **1. "Make driving decisions independently"**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Current systems (2024) operate at **Level 2-3 automation** (SAE scale), not full autonomy
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Level 5 (full autonomy)** remains largely theoretical/developmental
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Most "self-driving" cars still require human monitoring or operate in limited conditions
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m **2. Complexity understated**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Decision-making involves: sensor fusion, simultaneous localization and mapping (SLAM), prediction of other road users' behavior, and ethical algorithms
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Edge cases (snow, extreme weather, construction zones) remain challenging
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m **3. "Without requiring intervention"**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - This overstates current capabilities—most deployed systems require human readiness to take control
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Exceptions exist in controlled environments (closed campuses, fixed routes)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Regulatory/liability questions** remain unresolved in many jurisdictions
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Safety records** vary significantly between manufacturers
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Infrastructure dependency** (some systems rely on HD maps or specific road conditions)
