[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ## Nuances to Add
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m **⚠️ Slightly Incomplete/Overstated:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 1. **"Exponentially faster for certain problems"** - This is accurate but worth emphasizing:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - Quantum advantage is *proven* only for specific problem classes (e.g., factoring, database search)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - Many everyday problems show no quantum advantage
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - We're still in early stages of identifying all viable applications
