[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - Quantum computers could **break** current encryption (threat)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - They could also **enable** new encryption methods (opportunity)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - The summary should specify which aspect
