[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 3. **Current limitations not mentioned**:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - Quantum decoherence and error rates remain major challenges
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - We don't yet have large, stable, error-corrected quantum computers
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m    - Practical applications are still largely theoretical
