[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m Renewable energy is generated from natural sources that continuously replenish themselves, such as solar, wind, and hydroelectric power. These sustainable alternatives to fossil fuels help reduce carbon emissions and environmental impact while providing long-term energy security.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65388, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
