[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Scalability barriers**: Building fault-tolerant quantum computers remains difficult
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Not a universal solution**: Quantum computers won't replace classical computers; they're specialized tools
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
