[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - No mention of **immutability** (difficulty in reversing transactions)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Transaction speed trade-offs** not addressed (decentralization often sacrifices speed)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Energy consumption** concerns not mentioned (especially for Proof-of-Work systems)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Doesn't clarify that "transparency" varies—blockchain shows transaction existence but may obscure identities
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60945, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m The summary is a **solid, accessible introduction** but would benefit from noting the tradeoffs inherent in decentralized systems.
