[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m The summary makes broad claims about renewable energy's benefits (reducing fossil fuel dependence, mitigating environmental damage) but provides no concrete data, examples, or acknowledgment of real-world limitations. It doesn't address:
