[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m | **Not universally faster** | Quantum advantage only applies to specific problem types; many everyday tasks won't benefit |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m | **Error rates** | Current systems suffer from decoherence and operational errors, limiting practical utility |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m | **Scalability challenges** | Increasing qubit count while maintaining coherence remains technically difficult |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m | **Timeline uncertainty** | Useful large-scale quantum computers remain years to decades away (timeline disputed) |
