[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ✓ **Records transactions across multiple computers** - Accurate
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ✓ **Cryptographic security** - Properly used for securing blocks
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ✓ **Decentralized approach** - Valid for most blockchain implementations
