[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Immutability** is strong but not absolute—51% attacks can theoretically rewrite history on Proof-of-Work chains
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Transparency** varies significantly: Bitcoin is transparent; private blockchains (Hyperledger) restrict data visibility; some use zero-knowledge proofs that obscure transaction details
