[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - Validator consolidation (Ethereum)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - Governance token concentration
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - This remains aspirational rather than consistently achieved
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Unmentioned limitations:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Energy consumption (especially Proof-of-Work)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Scalability challenges
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Irreversibility of errors or fraud (feature and bug)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Regulatory gaps
