[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60700, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **"Automatically learn"** — ML systems learn according to designed algorithms, loss functions, and optimization procedures. They're not truly autonomous; human engineers make crucial choices about architecture, training data, and objectives
