[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ## Important Nuances to Add
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m **Current Reality:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Most commercial nanotechnology applications are currently **modest** rather than revolutionary
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Many promising applications remain in research phases, not yet market-ready
