[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m **Overstated Claims:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - The statement implies more transformative impact than currently realized
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - "Revolutionary" is aspirational for many fields rather than demonstrable today
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m **Legitimate Cautions:**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60704, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Environmental and health effects of some nanomaterials are still being studied
