[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m Renewable energy—generated from naturally replenishing sources such as solar, wind, hydroelectric, and geothermal power—provides a sustainable alternative to fossil fuels that reduces greenhouse gas emissions and environmental damage, though widespread adoption requires addressing challenges like intermittency, energy storage, and infrastructure investment.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
