[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65109, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m For example, "drug delivery" and "diagnostics" are presented as current applications, but many nanomedicine approaches are still in development stages. This blurs the line between proven technology and promising research, potentially misleading readers about how mature the field actually is. A stronger summary would clarify the maturity level of different applications.
