[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Prevention**: Firewalls, encryption, authentication
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Detection**: Intrusion detection systems, security monitoring
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Response**: Incident management, threat mitigation
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Recovery**: Data restoration, business continuity
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ## Scope Clarification
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m Cybersecurity encompasses more than just technology:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Technical measures**: Firewalls, encryption, patches
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Processes**: Security policies, incident response procedures
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **People**: Training, awareness, access controls
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Physical security**: Data center protection, device security
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ## Important Distinctions
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
