[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Network Security** (subset): Focuses specifically on network infrastructure
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Data Security** (subset): Emphasizes data protection across systems
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m 
