[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - Cost limitations
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - Integration difficulties with existing systems
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Current real-world applications are more limited than the phrasing suggests
