[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Development timelines from laboratory discovery to market are typically lengthy
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Current applications are more specialized than the broad framing implies
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61027, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
