[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66733, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Applications in treating genetic diseases** — Confirmed. Multiple clinical trials are underway (e.g., for sickle cell disease, certain blindness conditions).
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66733, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66733, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Applications in crop improvement** — Confirmed. Gene-edited crops are being developed and in some cases already commercialized.
