[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60699, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m Cybersecurity is the continuous practice of protecting computer systems, networks, and data from diverse threats—including malware, ransomware, phishing, and insider threats—through integrated technical measures (firewalls, encryption, authentication), processes (monitoring, incident response), and human awareness training to maintain information security and business continuity.
