[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64311, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m **2. Practical Limitations Not Mentioned**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=64311, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Decoherence**: Qubits are extremely fragile and lose quantum properties quickly
