[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=59863, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 1. **"Vast numbers of possibilities"**: More precise to say qubits explore a vastly larger state space. A system of n qubits spans 2^n dimensional state space, but measurement collapses to one classical outcome.
