[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Ethical concerns**: Germline editing, equity of access, and dual-use risks aren't mentioned
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66384, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Regulatory status**: Most applications remain experimental; few are widely available
