[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65746, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m Machine learning is a branch of artificial intelligence that allows systems to automatically learn and improve from data and experience without requiring explicit programming instructions. This capability enables computers to identify patterns, make predictions, and adapt their behavior based on new information.
