[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65388, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m The summary claims blockchain makes data "tamper-resistant" and "verifiable" but doesn't explain the mechanisms that accomplish this—such as cryptographic hashing, consensus algorithms, or the immutability created by linking blocks together. 
