[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m |-------|--------|------|
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m | "Solve certain complex problems exponentially faster" | **Partially qualified** | True only for *specific* problems. Quantum computers don't provide universal speedup—many problems see no advantage. |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m | "Potentially revolutionary" | **Speculative** | Based on theoretical potential; practical advantage hasn't been demonstrated on real-world problems yet. Current systems are in early stages. |
