[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Limitations**: Off-target effects, delivery challenges, mosaicism in some tissues
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Ethical concerns**: Germline editing remains controversial; regulatory status varies by country
