[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m ## Claims Needing Nuance ⚠️
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60913, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 1. **"Exponential speedups"**: Somewhat oversimplified. Not all problems gain exponential speedups; advantages are problem-specific. Many everyday tasks show no quantum benefit.
