[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Regulatory and legal barriers that remain unresolved
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - The gap between controlled testing environments and real-world complexity
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62642, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m This omission gives readers an incomplete and potentially misleading impression that autonomous vehicles are already a mature, ready-to-deploy solution, when the reality is far more nuanced.
