[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 2. **Problem-specific advantage**: Could note that speedup applies mainly to specific problem classes (optimization, simulation, cryptography), not general computing.
