[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m ### Missing Important Context
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Current limitations**: Most commercial nanotechnology applications today are relatively incremental (nanoparticles in cosmetics, textiles, sunscreen)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Timeline reality**: "Revolutionary" breakthroughs often take decades longer than predicted
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - **Challenges unmentioned**: 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m   - Manufacturing scalability
