[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Realistic timeline expectations
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Acknowledged technical hurdles
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60701, ip=10.0.10.50)[0m - Ethical considerations
