[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Naturally replenishing**: These sources regenerate naturally on human timescales.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Environmentally friendly**: Renewable energy generally produces minimal greenhouse gases during operation.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Reduce carbon emissions**: Switching from fossil fuels to renewables does lower net CO2 emissions.
