[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **"Sustainable alternatives"**: While renewable sources are theoretically infinite, their deployment has environmental costs (land use, manufacturing emissions, wildlife impacts) that deserve mention.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **"Help reduce climate change"**: More precisely, renewables *help mitigate* climate change when they replace fossil fuels. They're one part of a broader solution requiring efficiency improvements, behavior change, and other measures.
