[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - No mention of challenges: intermittency, storage limitations, grid integration, upfront costs, or manufacturing impacts
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - No discussion of geographic limitations (not all regions have equal solar/wind potential)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Missing other renewable sources: geothermal, tidal, biomass
