[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66733, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66733, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Long-term shifts in global temperatures and weather patterns**: Confirmed by IPCC reports and multiple climate datasets showing measurable changes over decades.
