[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 1. **"Experience" is imprecise**: ML systems don't learn from experience the way humans do. More accurately, they learn from *data* and *feedback signals*. The term "experience" can anthropomorphize the process.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66568, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
