[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Decentralized architecture**: Accurately reflects how blockchain operates without central authority
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Consensus requirement**: Correctly identifies that network agreement is needed before transactions are finalized
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Tamper resistance**: Valid—the cryptographic linking of blocks makes alteration extremely difficult
