[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m | "Securely records transactions" | **Depends on implementation.** Security varies by blockchain type (public, private, permissioned) and consensus mechanism |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60915, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m | "Ensures transparency" | **Partial truth.** Data visibility is transparent, but participant identities may be pseudonymous or hidden |
