[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **"Immutable record"**: 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61089, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m   - **Caveat**: While extremely difficult to alter, blockchain records aren't technically immutable. They can be altered through a 51% attack or hard forks (as seen with Ethereum's DAO recovery in 2016)
