[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m The summary presents an overwhelmingly positive view of gene editing without acknowledging significant concerns or challenges, such as:
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62380, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
