[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=66733, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m A stronger summary would provide concrete examples of specific advantages (e.g., "reduces greenhouse gas emissions by X%") and acknowledge legitimate drawbacks to give readers a more balanced understanding.
