[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Delivery challenges** (difficulty getting the editing tool into the right cells)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=61637, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Ethical concerns** (especially around germline/heritable editing)
