[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Secure and transparent recording**: Accurate—transactions use cryptography for security and are visible to network participants.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Tamper-resistant**: Valid—the chain-of-blocks structure with cryptographic hashing makes altering past records computationally impractical.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Decentralized**: Correct—no single authority controls the network (though some blockchains have varying degrees of centralization).
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Foundation for cryptocurrencies**: Bitcoin and Ethereum are indeed blockchain-based.
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60942, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - **Beyond-finance applications**: Legitimate examples include supply chain tracking and smart contracts.
