[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **"Transform industries from healthcare to manufacturing"** - ⚠️ **Premature language**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Current impact is measurable but incremental rather than transformative
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Timeline for widespread adoption is uncertain
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=62484, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Claims often conflate potential with current reality
