[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=67506, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Lack of concrete examples** – The summary describes machine learning in abstract terms but doesn't provide any real-world applications or concrete examples that would help readers understand how machine learning actually works in practice. Examples like email spam filters, recommendation systems (Netflix, Amazon), or image recognition would make the concept much more tangible and relatable.
