[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65748, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Quantum advantage is problem-specific (not universal)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65748, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - Current quantum computers are **not yet surpassing classical computers on most real-world tasks**
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65748, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m - The field is still largely experimental
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65748, ip=10.0.10.175)[0m 
