[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60912, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Records transactions**: Accurate function of most blockchain systems
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60912, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Multiple computers**: Valid description of decentralized networks
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60912, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Data integrity**: Blockchain does provide mechanisms for maintaining consistent, verifiable records
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60912, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - **Decentralized approach**: Accurate characterization of how most blockchains operate
