[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60912, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - No mention of scalability limitations
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60912, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m - Doesn't clarify that "transparent" can mean pseudonymous rather than fully anonymous
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60912, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=60912, ip=10.0.10.142)[0m **Overall**: The summary is fundamentally sound but presents security and immutability as more absolute than they actually are.
