[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m | "Resistant to fraud" | More accurate: *Resistant to certain types* of fraud; social engineering, private key theft, and smart contract bugs remain vulnerabilities |
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m | "All participants can verify" | True, but many users rely on others rather than running full nodes themselves |
