[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - No mention of **performance trade-offs** (slower than centralized systems)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Energy consumption** concerns not addressed (especially Proof of Work)
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - **Scalability limitations** not noted
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m - Doesn't distinguish between **public vs. private blockchains**
