[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m 
[36m(_strands_fanout_task pid=65589, ip=10.0.10.235)[0m The summary is **fundamentally accurate but somewhat idealized**—it emphasizes benefits while omitting practical limitations and exceptions.
